<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RM Williams half yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RM Williams half yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    2.28  vs  1.55</p>
<p>    Net				     2.29  vs  1.49</p>
<p>    Interim dividend		    nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  19.36  vs 17.11</p>
<p>NOTE: R.M. Williams Holdings Ltd is a clothing and footwear manufacturer and retailer</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
